  "body": "## Overview\n\nMTP does not implement `get_state`/`set_state`, so restoring target and draft KV checkpoints leaves the later batch's hidden state in the speculative driver.\n\nSave and restore `pending_h` and the verification hidden rows through the existing hooks. Validate the model width, row count and payload size before changing state, and clear transient batch data after a successful restore.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Added `test-speculative-mtp-state`.\n- Without the patch at `08246a2`: fails with `MTP hidden state was not saved`.\n- With the patch: passes on Qwen3.5-2B (CPU and Metal) and Gemma4 E2B with its assistant model (Metal, shared KV).\n- Checks draft token equality after restore, verification row restoration, malformed input rejection and isolation between sequences.\n- Full CI has not been run.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- I have read and agree with the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n- AI usage disclosure: YES. Codex assisted with the upstream implementation and regression tests under human direction.\n",
